{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Lest I come out against you with the sword.</b> For the multitude of the people of Edom are men of blood, and over a small matter — a quarrel or anything of the sort — that might arise between the men of the land and the passing people, the men of the land will rouse themselves with the sword against those who pass through."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:23.386392847Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}